@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@customer = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Catalog
GET {{host}}/products

### Add a product
POST {{host}}/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id":"{{customer}}","product_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","quantity":1}

### Read cart
GET {{host}}/cart?customer_id={{customer}}

### Create a pending order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id":"{{customer}}"}
